  "details": "EDIT: I just forgot to enable preview packages in the config file. Ignore this post.\n\nAs it stands now, VCC just ignores package versions that are marked as alpha (using the semver protocol).\n\nSince I know you guys use the SemanticVersioning library, this issue should be easily solvable by just using `Version.TryParse(raw, true, out var version)` instead of `Version.TryParse(raw, out var version)`.\n\nEXAMPLE:\n\n`1.0.0` is valid\n\n`1.0.0-aplha` is invalid\n\n`1.0.0-aplha.1` is invalid",
